  "observations": [
    "Node evaluation required the staged additional UTxOs; restored by commit 0e00e797.",
    "A finalized transaction exceeded Lucid automatic collateral by 11418 lovelace; the configured floor is now 8000000 lovelace (5bdaca0a).",
    "A short rollback removed staged transactions after initial inclusion; growth was restarted from the canonical client state.",
    "Yaci lost epoch nonce continuity after rollback; an independent replay from retained blocks recovered continuous canonical evidence without inserting nonce rows.",
    "Native Hermes rejected self-funded finalization without an ordinary wallet input. Commit eb1b432d explicitly collects a signer input for verification, finalization and cancellation stages; the subsequent Hermes finalization was accepted.",
    "With the default 32-block header batch, a combined catch-up and connection confirmation lacked proof-height processed metadata. The explicit Hermes update-client command completed bounded catch-up; subsequent local handshakes use a 256-block batch with the unchanged 786432-byte header cap.",
    "Ogmios 7 returned JSON-RPC -32600 Invalid request: empty. for one explicitly supplied channel reference script. Removing only script-reference overrides made the unchanged transaction evaluate successfully from canonical ledger data. Commit 3b01fd07 extends the existing compatibility fallback; native channel initialization was then signed and node-accepted."
  ],
